{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>CHIIKAWA再次聯乘MINISO推出夏日水果造型系列！今次小可愛們都變成清爽的生果，例如西瓜小八、香蕉兔兔、車厘子Chii飛鼠，造型非常可愛！如果想要小小的公仔掛件，今次系列都有，而且價錢相宜，49.9人民幣就可以帶他們回家，可以掛在手袋上，帶他們周圍去～</p><p>除了公仔掛件，還有攬枕、布袋、髮夾、電話繩、貼紙、相機仔等等，好實用！</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/178542725393397389_2125906286a6b753664c3f.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/178542725572268468_15497528466a6b753846179.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/178542725775884195_18323821486a6b753a225ed.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/178542725953183920_11383077566a6b753c16fc0.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/178542726123537849_17129129666a6b753dd4041.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/178542726318345481_13748332846a6b753fb9cff.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文 新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-30T16:20:02.590065+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":237,"images":6,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"}}